# Build output destination (optional).
#
# `npm run build` always bundles to main.js in the repository root. If this
# variable is set, it additionally copies main.js, manifest.json, and
# styles.css into the directory below.
#
# This must point at the plugin folder itself (the directory Obsidian loads
# main.js from), NOT the vault root.
#
# If unset, the sync step is skipped and only the root main.js is produced.
# If the copy fails, the build still succeeds with a warning, since the root
# bundle is what the release workflow publishes.
#
# Example:
# OBSIDIAN_PLUGIN_PATH=/path/to/your/vault/.obsidian/plugins/antigravity
